<!--FA404C1A64CF4C19B4BAF2CECCBEEB07-->  <NAME><![CDATA[Process Vector Reindex]]></NAME>
<!--FA404C1A64CF4C19B4BAF2CECCBEEB07-->  <DESCRIPTION><![CDATA[Enqueues the records a vector search source held before it was instrumented.]]></DESCRIPTION>
<!--FA404C1A64CF4C19B4BAF2CECCBEEB07-->  <HELP><![CDATA[The generated triggers only capture changes made from the moment they exist, so a source configured over a table with history starts out empty. This process walks the source table in key order and appends an indexing event per record, storing how far it got so an interrupted run continues instead of starting over. It stops while the source still has a large backlog waiting to be delivered, and resumes on a later run.]]></HELP>
